  "title": "CJP protest: Sonam Wangchuk opens a window for talks as Government steps up efforts to resolve crisis",
  "summary": "The Indian Express Latest reports that Sonam Wangchuk, a key figure in the government’s efforts to resolve the crisis, has opened a window for talks with Union Ministers Nadda and Jitendra Singh. Wangchuk was brought to the hospital under tight security after a Delhi HC order.",
